OL,8,FSpeaker of the House - accuses the
OL,9,F"Trump Cartel" of "massive corruption"
OL,10,Fand adds: "We are going to hold the
OL,11,Fcrooks accountable"
OL,13,FSeveral results are yet to be called -
OL,14,Fhere's the current state of play in the
OL,15,FSenate and the House
